{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33198","headline":"漾陂晚望 · 司马扎","name":"漾陂晚望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远客家水国，此来如到乡。\n何人垂白发，一叶钓残阳。\n柳暗鸟乍起，渚深兰自芳。\n因知帝城下，有路向沧浪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马扎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33198.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33198","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}